### Pictures ###
# the mod ships without pictures: the player imports their own. `art/arts.json` is an empty catalogue ("[]").
# Anything else dropped here for a private build stays out of the repository.
src/main/resources/assets/zaecguimod/textures/art/*
!src/main/resources/assets/zaecguimod/textures/art/arts.json

